.TH DDN "1" "2026\-11\-25" "ddnetmirror 1.0.0" "ddnetmirror manual"
.SH NAME
ddn \- build Containerlab labs from Arista CloudVision data
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ddn
[-h] [--version] COMMAND
.SH DESCRIPTION
ddnetmirror. Run 'ddn COMMAND \-\-help' for a command's options.

.TP
\fBCOMMAND\fR
fetch, fixup or build

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
show program's version number and exit

.SH COMMENTS
commands:
  fetch   fetch running configs from CloudVision (ddnetmirror\-fetch\-config)
  fixup   apply text fixup rules to a copy of a config (ddnetmirror\-fixup)
  build   generate the lab in ./ddnetmirror.yml (configs and topology)

.SH DISTRIBUTION
The latest version of ddnetmirror may be downloaded from
.UR https://github.com/DaphnisDuck/ddnetmirror
.UE
